# Admin chip controls

Toolbar pills on the admin side must match **Manage tags**:

- `text-[12px] font-semibold leading-none`
- `h-9` / `min-h-[36px]`, `gap-1.5`, `px-3`, `rounded-full`

Use helpers from `src/lib/admin-ui.ts`:

- `adminChipClass()` — secondary outline chips (Manage tags, Back to…)
- `adminSegmentClass(active)` — Newest / A–Z style toggles
- `adminPrimaryChipClass()` — compact filled CTAs (New setlist, Add) — same size, `font-bold`

Do not invent one-off `text-[11px]` / `text-sm` / mismatched heights for these toolbar controls.

**Gotcha:** Global `button { font: inherit }` overrides Tailwind font utilities on buttons (links are fine). Keep `font-family: inherit` only in `globals.css`.
